### Ontology Version 1.0.0 ###

### Class: Course
iscarb-learning:Course a owl:Class ;
  rdfs:label "Course" .

iscarb-learning:id a owl:DatatypeProperty ;
  rdfs:domain iscarb-learning:Course .

iscarb-learning:code a owl:DatatypeProperty ;
  rdfs:domain iscarb-learning:Course .

